 lang=\"ja\">ふあん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">不安；忧虑；担心；焦虑；恐惧；缺乏安全感；悬念</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">作</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>制作；生产；准备；建造</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サク・サ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つく.る・つく.り・-づく.り</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">作文</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さくぶん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">写作（文章、散文等）；作文；空洞的正式文章；形式化的写作</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">作る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つくる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">制造；生产；制作；建造；建设；烹饪；酿造；养育；种植；栽培；训练；耕种；开垦；起草；制定；准备；写；创作；谱写；创造；组织；建立；创办；生（孩子）；生育；化妆；装扮；编造；捏造；假装；装出；作出虚假的样子；排成；形成；创下（纪录）；犯下；作下</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">作業</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さぎょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">工作；操作；任务</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">用</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>使用；用途；事务；服务；采用</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">もち.いる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">用</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">事务；差事；任务；用途；用处；供……使用；为……而作；生理需要；排泄</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">用意</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ようい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">准备；安排；整理；摆设</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">用事</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ようじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">事务；差事；约定；事情</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">度</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>次数；度（角度/温度等）；程度；每次；考虑</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ド・ト・タク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たび・-た.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">もう一度</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もういちど</span><span class=\"k-wz\">再一次；又一遍</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">一度</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いちど</span><span class=\"k-wz\">一次；一回；一遍；暂时；片刻；一时；一度；一个音程</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">今度</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こんど</span><span class=\"k-wz\">这次；现在；下次；改天；不久；很快；最近；近来；前些天</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">強</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>强大；强硬；加强；勉强；强行</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョウ・ゴウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つよ.い・つよ.まる・つよ.める・し.いる・こわ.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">強い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つよい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">强大；有力；专横；坚韧；强壮；魁梧；有力；健壮；粗犷；擅长；熟练；精通；能够应对；会处理；耐用；耐得住；有韧性；坚固；刚硬；牢实；强烈；猛烈；激烈；高度；可靠；值得信赖</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">勉強</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">べんきょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">学习；研究；勤奋；刻苦；经验；教训；折扣；优惠；降价</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">強調</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうちょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">强调；着重；突出；划线标注；强调（某一特征或部分）；着重突出；（行情）强势；坚挺</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">公</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>公共；官方；公开；君主；公家</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ・ク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おおやけ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">公園</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうえん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">公园；公共园林</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">公務員</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうむいん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">公务员；政府雇员；公职人员；公共部门职员</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">公平</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうへい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">公平；公正；正义；客观</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">持</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>持有；拥有；保持</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">も.つ・-も.ち・も.てる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">持つ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">拿；握；持；携带；拥有；具有；占有；保持；维持；保留；耐久；经久；持久；维持；掌管；主持；负责；举行；召开；拥有；具有特殊气质；天赋异禀；幸运</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">気持ち</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きもち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">感受；感觉；心情；精神状态；准备；就绪；态度；想法；感情；体谅；感谢；略微；有点；稍微</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">お金持ち</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おかねもち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">富人；有钱人；财主</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">野</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>田野；原野；乡间；民间；粗野</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヤ・ショ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">の・の-</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">野菜</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やさい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">蔬菜；大麻；大麻制品</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">野</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">の</span><span class=\"k-wz\">田野；平原；（建筑物或物体的）隐蔽内部；野生的（用于动物或植物）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">分野</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぶんや</span><span class=\"k-wz\">领域；范围；部门；分支</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">以</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>凭借；因为；鉴于；与…相比</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">イ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">もっ.て</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">以下</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">不超过……；……以下；……或以下；……或更少；低于（某标准、水平等）；在……以下；不足……；以下；下述；下列；其余部分；后接……；包括……在内；……及其他（员工、官员等）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">以外</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いがい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">除外；除了；除…以外；另外；此外；范围外；界限外</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">以上</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いじょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">不少于……；……以上；……及以上；……或更多；超出（如超出预期）；超越；多于；进一步；上述；上述的；前述；前面提到的；既然……；由于……；既然如此；一旦……；仅此而已；到此为止；结束</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">思</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>思考；认为；打算；怀念；推测</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おも.う・おもえら.く・おぼ.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">思う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おもう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">想；认为；相信；推测；想要做；打算做；判断；评估；认为；想象；假设；梦想；期待；盼望；感受；处于（某种心理状态）；渴望；想要；深切关心；渴望；担忧；热爱；回忆；记得</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">思い出す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おもいだす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">想起；回忆；回想</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">意思</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">意图；愿望；目的；心意</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">世</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>世代；世界；社会；公众</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セイ・セ・ソウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">世界</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">世界；社会；宇宙；领域；圈子；（某一）界；世界闻名的；享誉世界的；（佛教）佛国；一佛所统摄的世界</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">世話</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せわ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">照顾；照看；帮助；协助；援助；麻烦；烦扰；关照；推荐；介绍；日常生活；日常事务；日常用语；世话物（江户时代以当代生活为题材的戏剧）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">世紀</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">世纪；时代；年代；世纪的；世纪之战般的</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">多</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>多；频繁；大量</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">タ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おお.い・まさ.に・まさ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">多い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おおい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">多；众多；许多；大量；许多；频繁；常见</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">多少</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たしょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">少许；一些；有几分；在某种程度上；数量；数目；多少</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">滅多に</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">めったに</span><span class=\"k-wz\">很少；难得；罕见</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">正</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>正确；正义；正当；恰好；10的40次方</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セイ・ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ただ.しい・ただ.す・まさ・まさ.に</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">正しい</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ただしい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">正确；对的；正当；正义；诚实；真实；合法</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">正</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（逻辑）真；正规；10的40次方；正；正本；原件；正数；大于零；（辩证法）正题</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">修正</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅうせい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">修正；改正；修改；修订；调整；润饰；更新；修复</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">安</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>便宜；安静；平安；轻松；放心</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">アン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">やす.い・やす.まる・やす・やす.らか</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">安い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やすい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">便宜；廉价；平静；安宁；安静</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">安心</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あんしん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">安心；放心；心安；安全感；保障；自信</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">安全</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あんぜん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">安全；保障</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">心</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>心；内心；精神；心思；感情</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">こころ・-ごころ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">心</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こころ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">心灵；思想；精神；（谜语等的）含义；意思</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">安心</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あんしん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">安心；放心；心安；安全感；保障；自信</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">心配</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんぱい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">担心；忧虑；焦虑；不安；恐惧；关心；照料；帮助；援助；协助</span></li></ul></div></li>"]